{"id":"06b025d5c611f287","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction.md","title":"System F的两种β保持类型","display":"thm-system-f-subject-reduction — System F的两种β保持类型","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction","aliases":["72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction"],"display":"thm-system-f-subject-reduction — System F的两种β保持类型","depends_on":["[[72-df-system-f]]","[[72-lem-system-f-substitution]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §11.1 print81–82/PDF89–90 freshly rechecked; local derivation below","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-system-f-subject-reduction — System F的两种β保持类型"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6061af339630925b\" href=\"?note=6061af339630925b\" title=\"72-lem-system-f-substitution\">72-lem-system-f-substitution</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §§2.2,3.6, print698–700,741/PDF710–712,753 (context); local consequences of the existing typed lambda interfaces; supplementary Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), §11.1 print81–82/PDF89–90 freshly rechecked; local derivation below"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F,\\Lambda_F\">\\(\\Gamma,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F,\\Lambda_F\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a59aab1599221f4a\" href=\"?note=a59aab1599221f4a\" title=\"72-df-system-f\">72-df-system-f</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_F\">\\(\\beta_F\\)</span> 同时含项应用收缩与类型应用收缩。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N\\in\\Lambda_F\">\\(M,N\\in\\Lambda_F\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta_F^*\">\\(\\beta_F^*\\)</span> 为该项载体上的有限反身传递闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_F^*\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_F N:A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_F^*\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_F N:A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项可约式用项代入引理。类型可约式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\Lambda U.P)[B]\">\\((\\Lambda U.P)[B]\\)</span> 的typing反演给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash P:C\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash P:C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\">\\(U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，类型代入引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma[B/U]\\vdash P[B/U]:C[B/U]\">\\(\\Gamma[B/U]\\vdash P[B/U]:C[B/U]\\)</span>；旁条件使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma[B/U]=\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma[B/U]=\\Gamma\\)</span>，结果即原类型。对五类兼容context分别重新应用typing规则，再对有限步数归纳。只核对本册已给定System F语法的局部元理论，不宣称重新核验原始强正规化文献。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-system-f]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-system-f-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"6061af339630925b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-system-f-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-system-f","status":"resolved","id":"a59aab1599221f4a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F,\\Lambda_F$ 同 [[72-df-system-f]]；$\\beta_F$ 同时含项应用收缩与类型应用收缩。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma,\\vdash_F,\\beta_F,\\Lambda_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_F","display":false},{"tex":"M,N\\in\\Lambda_F","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_F","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta_F^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash_F M:A\\land\\langle M,N\\rangle\\in\\beta_F^*\\\n\\Longrightarrow\\ \\Gamma\\vdash_F N:A.","display":true},{"tex":"(\\Lambda U.P)[B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash P:C","display":false},{"tex":"U\\notin\\operatorname{FTV}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma[B/U]\\vdash P[B/U]:C[B/U]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma[B/U]=\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1810,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-484","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction|thm-system-f-subject-reduction — System F的两种β保持类型]]"},{"id":"5acae5514919cc4d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"99aa8943f30c6e5e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"2026-10-22：用 [[72-thm-system-f-subject-reduction]] 将输出类型补入原存在结论。该保持证明同时处理项β与类型β；完整强正规化的历史未重建限制仍保留。"}],"outgoing":["a59aab1599221f4a","6061af339630925b"]}